From: Local MTT S30 compatibility maintenance
Subject: [PATCH] kwin: constrain mtgpu formats with its current context

The reviewed 3.1.0 driver queries secondary formats without a current
context, while its primary DMA-BUF import validates a different table.
After binding an S30 context, re-query and intersect the cached format and
modifier sets. Do not add capabilities, blacklist a pixel format, or ignore
image import failures. Reject missing/inconsistent format evidence and an
empty renderable intersection; omit formats with rejected modifier queries
instead of inventing implicit support. Other drivers keep the old path.

No class data members or system-installed libraries are changed.

